cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use these packings or tools, please cite them as below."
title: "Moki&Julio: 4,666 new best-known packings of equal circles in fifteen Packomania containers"
authors:
  - name: "Moki&Julio"
date-released: 2026-09-25
version: "2.2"
license: CC-BY-4.0
keywords:
  - circle packing
  - equal circles
  - Packomania
  - best-known packings
  - exact certificates
abstract: >-
  4,666 packings of equal circles that improve the best-known records of Packomania's tables for the isosceles right
  triangle (crt), the circular quadrant (ccq), eight fixed rectangles (crc_100 to crc_800), the semicircle (csc), the unit
  square (csq) and the regular pentagon (cpt), 15-gon (cpd) and 16-gon (cxd), each with an exact certificate verified by two
  independently written exact checkers. Results already surpassed in the literature are excluded by a prior-art gate. Also:
  58 table entries proven optimal by Füredi's bound for thin rectangles and two proven optimal by an exact computer-assisted proof.
